# Project Info

## Project Overview
**Divinity Health & Fitness** - Woombye's ONLY 24-Hour Gym website. A static HTML/CSS/JavaScript website for a fitness training business in Queensland, Australia.

## Key Features
### User Experience
- Responsive mobile-first design
- Smooth scrolling navigation
- Interactive hamburger menu for mobile
- Form validation and feedback with EmailJS integration
- Loading animations and hover effects
- Back-to-top functionality
- Image slideshow for gym photos

### Content Sections
- **Homepage (index.html)**: Hero section with slideshow, team members, service highlights, call-to-action
- **About (about.html)**: Trainer background, certifications, training philosophy, credentials
- **Programs (programs.html)**: Detailed training packages, pricing, program descriptions, packages
- **Contact (contact.html)**: Contact form with EmailJS integration, business information, hours of operation

### Interactive Elements
- Mobile navigation toggle (hamburger menu)
- Contact form with EmailJS integration for email sending
- Smooth scroll to anchor links
- Responsive image galleries with slideshow
- Hover animations on buttons and cards
- Image slideshow with navigation controls

## Technology Stack
- **HTML5**: Semantic markup
- **CSS3**: Custom properties, Flexbox, Grid, responsive design
- **JavaScript (Vanilla)**: No frameworks, pure JavaScript
- **EmailJS**: Contact form email service integration
- **Nginx**: Web server for production (EC2 deployment)

