## Development Information
### Browser Compatibility
- Modern browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge)
- Mobile browsers (iOS Safari, Chrome Mobile)
- Responsive breakpoints: Mobile (≤768px), Tablet (768-1024px), Desktop (≥1024px)

### Performance Considerations
- Optimized images and assets
- Minimal external dependencies (only EmailJS CDN)
- Efficient CSS with custom properties (CSS variables)
- Lightweight JavaScript functionality
- Global image constraints to prevent massive images on hosted sites

### Customization Points
- Color scheme easily adjustable via CSS custom properties in `:root`
- Content sections clearly separated for easy editing
- Image paths clearly defined for asset updates
- Contact information centralized in HTML files
- EmailJS credentials in `script.js` (EMAILJS_CONFIG object)

## Image Handling
### Critical CSS Rule
All images MUST have global constraints to prevent massive display on hosted sites:
```css
img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
}
```
**Why**: Images display at natural size (often 3000-5000px) without constraints when hosted, even if they look fine locally.

### Image Locations
- **Team Photos**: `gym-photos/TeamPhotos/` - Used in team section on homepage
- **Primary Gym Photos**: `gym-photos/Primary/` - Used in slideshows and galleries
- **Logo**: `Logo/Picture 1.png` - Used in navigation

## EmailJS Integration
- **Service**: EmailJS for contact form submissions
- **Configuration**: Located in `script.js` (EMAILJS_CONFIG object)
- **Required Credentials**: SERVICE_ID, TEMPLATE_ID, PUBLIC_KEY
- **CDN**: Loaded from `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@emailjs/browser@4/dist/email.min.js`
- **Note**: Domain must be allowed in EmailJS dashboard for production

## Deployment Information
### Current Deployment
- **Hosting**: AWS EC2 instance with Nginx
- **Repository**: GitHub - `git@github.com:LargeNuT22/ElijahsWebServer.git`
- **Branch**: `node-version` (active branch)
- **Server Path**: `/var/www/ElijahsWebServer/`
- **Web Server**: Nginx configured to serve from `/var/www/ElijahsWebServer/`

### Deployment Process
1. **Local Development**: Make changes locally
2. **Commit & Push**: 
   ```bash
   git add .
   git commit -m "Description"
   git push origin node-version
   ```
3. **Server Update**:
   ```bash
   ssh -i "key.pem" ubuntu@ec2-ip
   cd /var/www/ElijahsWebServer
   sudo git pull origin node-version
   sudo chown -R www-data:www-data /var/www/ElijahsWebServer/
   sudo chmod -R 755 /var/www/ElijahsWebServer/
   sudo systemctl restart nginx
   ```

### Deployment Files
- `ec2-deployment-guide.md` - Complete EC2 setup instructions
- `ec2-update-commands.md` - Quick update commands
- `DEPLOYMENT_INSTRUCTIONS.md` - Deployment checklist and troubleshooting
- `MANUAL_PUSH_GUIDE.md` - Manual push instructions if network issues

